    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Okinawa Journal</strong> is a point-and-click mystery game set during the summer of 2000 in the serene yet mysterious landscapes of Okinawa. You step into the ethereal role of Kami, a guardian angel tasked with guiding Haruki, a struggling journalist, as he delves into the baffling disappearance of a beloved actress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494660/extras/ffbd83669ce08630604da861242ae438.poster.avif?t=1755376334\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494660/extras/ffbd83669ce08630604da861242ae438.webm?t=1755376334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494660/extras/ffbd83669ce08630604da861242ae438.mp4?t=1755376334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you\u2019ll meet a diverse cast of characters\u2014both human and spirit\u2014each harboring their own secrets, ambitions, and obligations. As the investigation unfolds, you\u2019ll uncover a web of hidden truths tied to Okinawa\u2019s dark past, with consequences that linger in the present.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494660/extras/5c433125dca7e6216d97fc32882320c8.poster.avif?t=1755376334\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494660/extras/5c433125dca7e6216d97fc32882320c8.webm?t=1755376334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494660/extras/5c433125dca7e6216d97fc32882320c8.mp4?t=1755376334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With challenging decisions, intriguing locations to explore, and multiple endings to discover, <strong>Okinawa Journal</strong> invites you to shape a story where every choice carries weight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494660/extras/007b0a95ad011c2858fd1f92b9a59a60.poster.avif?t=1755376334\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494660/extras/007b0a95ad011c2858fd1f92b9a59a60.webm?t=1755376334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494660/extras/007b0a95ad011c2858fd1f92b9a59a60.mp4?t=1755376334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Haruki's Insight, you'll always know what still interests him. Also, Okinawa Journal is a succinctly written text-based game. There are no walls of text or meandering dialogue. The characters in the game summarize all their interactions in thought, which you, as a guardian angel, are able to understand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494660/extras/f682a3f2ddc572e1b2468b6a7f753520.poster.avif?t=1755376334\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494660/extras/f682a3f2ddc572e1b2468b6a7f753520.webm?t=1755376334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494660/extras/f682a3f2ddc572e1b2468b6a7f753520.mp4?t=1755376334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Okinawa Journal is <strong>Steam Deck</strong> compatible.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Okinawa Journal</strong> is a point-and-click mystery game set during the summer of 2000 in the serene yet mysterious landscapes of Okinawa. You step into the ethereal role of Kami, a guardian angel tasked with guiding Haruki, a struggling journalist, as he delves into the baffling disappearance of a beloved actress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494660/extras/ffbd83669ce08630604da861242ae438.poster.avif?t=1755376334\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494660/extras/ffbd83669ce08630604da861242ae438.webm?t=1755376334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494660/extras/ffbd83669ce08630604da861242ae438.mp4?t=1755376334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you\u2019ll meet a diverse cast of characters\u2014both human and spirit\u2014each harboring their own secrets, ambitions, and obligations. As the investigation unfolds, you\u2019ll uncover a web of hidden truths tied to Okinawa\u2019s dark past, with consequences that linger in the present.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494660/extras/5c433125dca7e6216d97fc32882320c8.poster.avif?t=1755376334\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494660/extras/5c433125dca7e6216d97fc32882320c8.webm?t=1755376334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494660/extras/5c433125dca7e6216d97fc32882320c8.mp4?t=1755376334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With challenging decisions, intriguing locations to explore, and multiple endings to discover, <strong>Okinawa Journal</strong> invites you to shape a story where every choice carries weight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494660/extras/007b0a95ad011c2858fd1f92b9a59a60.poster.avif?t=1755376334\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494660/extras/007b0a95ad011c2858fd1f92b9a59a60.webm?t=1755376334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494660/extras/007b0a95ad011c2858fd1f92b9a59a60.mp4?t=1755376334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Haruki's Insight, you'll always know what still interests him. Also, Okinawa Journal is a succinctly written text-based game. There are no walls of text or meandering dialogue. The characters in the game summarize all their interactions in thought, which you, as a guardian angel, are able to understand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494660/extras/f682a3f2ddc572e1b2468b6a7f753520.poster.avif?t=1755376334\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494660/extras/f682a3f2ddc572e1b2468b6a7f753520.webm?t=1755376334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494660/extras/f682a3f2ddc572e1b2468b6a7f753520.mp4?t=1755376334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Okinawa Journal is <strong>Steam Deck</strong> compatible.</p>",
